      "id": "18177082456420521",
      "text": "eating curd rice with your hands is the only way.\n\nif you use a spoon, you're doing it wrong.",
      "posted_at": 1785264145.804473,
      "views": 31,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1785844447.2288845
    },
    {
      "id": "17949122184081374",
      "text": "people who send 'k' as a reply are just begging to be blocked immediately.",
      "posted_at": 1785299275.1228974,
      "views": 2,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1785844447.2288845
    },
    {
      "id": "18171548038428754",
      "text": "my life is 30% surviving, 70% wondering what i should watch while i eat.",
      "posted_at": 1785309356.3066092,
      "views": 162,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 1,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1785844447.2288845
    },
    {
      "id": "17878693902653911",
      "text": "ceiling fans on full speed even in winter is the only correct way to sleep.",
      "posted_at": 1785326027.4328482,
      "views": 225,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 1,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1785844447.2288845
    },
    {
      "id": "18104610794148642",
      "text": "genuinely don't understand how people can fall asleep without a podcast playing in the background.",
      "posted_at": 1785339280.3776715,
      "views": 82,
      "replies": 3,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1785844447.2288845
    },
    {
      "id": "17893213224584897",
      "text": "everyone who says they prefer winter over summer is just lying to sound edgy.",
      "posted_at": 1785354034.185545,
      "views": 337,
      "replies": 2,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1785844447.2288845
    },
    {
      "id": "18110094637802259",
      "text": "the person who decided that we should eat breakfast at 8am has caused us all irreparable damage.",
      "posted_at": 1785385030.9420831,
      "views": 185,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 3,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1785844447.2288845
    },
    {
      "id": "18022160630897495",
      "text": "i can track my mental stability by how many tabs i have open on my browser.\n\ncurrently at 47.",
      "posted_at": 1785395285.5868964,
      "views": 362,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 3,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1785844447.2288845
    },
    {
      "id": "18081442967274336",
      "text": "folding your clothes directly from the dryer vs leaving them in the basket for a week.\n\nbe honest.",
      "posted_at": 1785411157.3753552,
      "views": 251,
      "replies": 8,
      "likes": 4,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1785844447.2288845
    },
    {
      "id": "18106973111029571",
      "text": "there is a special kind of guilt that comes with buying a drink and not finishing it.",
      "posted_at": 1785425004.4647422,
      "views": 189,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1785844447.2288845
    },
    {
      "id": "17973544398084132",
      "text": "biryani without potatoes is just spicy rice and you are all delusional.",
      "posted_at": 1785435064.6658337,
      "views": 121,
      "replies": 3,
      "likes": 3,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1785844447.2288845
    },
    {
      "id": "18153726172442478",
      "text": "why do we pretend that 10 minutes of scrolling in bed isn't actually two hours?",
      "posted_at": 1785469763.2991695,
      "views": 295,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 3,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1785844447.2288845
    },
    {
      "id": "18015466928871474",
      "text": "people who use the 'typing...' bubble to stress others out are the actual worst.",
      "posted_at": 1785479790.8224983,
      "views": 4,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1785844447.2288845
    },
    {
      "id": "18122527123840280",
      "text": "the urge to start a completely new life every time i hear a sad song is real.",
      "posted_at": 1785490292.6545792,
      "views": 367,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 4,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1785844447.2288845
    },
    {
      "id": "18042101825804946",
      "text": "drinking water from a glass is fine, but it hits different out of a steel tumbler.",
      "posted_at": 1785504556.1915894,
      "views": 234,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 2,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1785844447.2288845
    },
    {
      "id": "18045707540632564",
      "text": "the 2am decision to completely rearrange your entire room furniture. no one is safe.",
      "posted_at": 1785517846.5423393,
      "views": 218,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 8,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1785844447.2288845
    },
    {
      "id": "18208799335356072",
      "text": "people who iron their bedsheets are living in a different reality than us.",
      "posted_at": 1785528488.2488422,
      "views": 172,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1785844447.2288845
    },
    {
      "id": "18110044586585438",
      "text": "if you leave your phone screen facing up in public, you\u2019re either confident or insane.",
      "posted_at": 1785558817.7314637,
      "views": 97,
      "replies": 2,
      "likes": 1,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1785844447.2288845
    },
    {
      "id": "18123671824701930",
      "text": "tea with biscuits is fine but the anxiety of it breaking in the chai is peak cinema.",
      "posted_at": 1785575985.8757117,
      "views": 197,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1785844447.2288845
    },
    {
      "id": "17995827989806631",
      "text": "using an umbrella for sun protection is the ultimate sign of adulting. fight me.",
      "posted_at": 1785588850.2972052,
      "views": 428,
      "replies": 0,
      "likes": 0,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1785844447.2288845
    },
    {
      "id": "18016672697880581",
      "text": "people who use a knife to cut pizza are missing the entire point of living.",
      "posted_at": 1785598462.886305,
      "views": 241,
      "replies": 9,
      "likes": 3,
      "reposts": 0,
      "last_fetched": 1785844447.2288845
    },
    {
      "id": "18177767461420072",
      "text": "waking up naturally before your alarm is a power move or a threat.",
